{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"c98f8dcb7b8c36d06692b52360bcb71fd86cff92d21bc22274b140e5c5226ef7","ja":"一番効率的な方法","zh":"最高效的方法","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"214475af3676debafd12ccf512ee9d64647b61728591c0ccc630987405a4d0df","ja":"ドンガラガッシャーン……ッ！","zh":"噼里啪啦稀里哗啦……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"774a7781f2f85bcfebc5e7159a9546346f467143ce6c66a4dc94aae7b3c40618","ja":"だ、大丈夫、瑞希ちゃん！？　ケガはしてない？","zh":"没、没事吧，小瑞希！？没有受伤吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d70d6b196314ca0f10aebb07586ab638ce9b1a1b41e287e89e82e2a72d4b7529","ja":"はい、大丈夫です。\nですが、中身がすべて飛び出てしまいました。","zh":"是的，我没事。\n但是，里面的东西全都飞出来了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8eea37d41c63902f8f298e9da99c48c05a14426e71c3320705b928f1bcd92fc7","ja":"ケガがなくてよかった。それに、壊れそうなものは\n入ってなかったみたいだよ。一緒に片付けよう。","zh":"人没事就好。而且里面好像\n也没有易碎物品。我们一起收拾吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e24a4c2e79eda7bbd0b8937a2ea047f7093d2dd6bf43db0a5eacdf498d4bb53f","ja":"ですが、萩原さんの手も止まってしまいます。\nせっかく勝つチャンスなのに……。","zh":"但是，萩原同学的手也停了下来。\n明明是获胜的大好机会……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"49c418b17737796f6438fa684ecd5ea78247f82bcfd46a3992a72390768fe8fa","ja":"いいよ。だって私たち、\n競争相手だけど、敵じゃないんだから。","zh":"没问题。因为我们虽然是\n竞争对手，但可不是敌人呀。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3d1a2c4ae023a21247052d01acd6f132a333142fd807a9e3ae8861a6a91329d9","ja":"ひとりじゃ大変だなって時は、\n協力し合ってもいいと思うんだけど……どうかな？","zh":"要是觉得一个人应付不过来，\n我觉得互相协作也是可以的……你觉得呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"70152d57890514b1b76db929b92cb28716b3984d193fa543f70dcca546be2cf4","ja":"……そうですね。\nでは、片付けのお手伝い、お願いします。","zh":"……也是呢。\n那就麻烦你帮忙收拾一下了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"7ab5fab0cbb36d272ab2079d6995adb40e0686ac7481ba3dfcf93f0103b26327","ja":"ふぅ……やっと終わったぁ。\n思ったより早く終わってよかったね！","zh":"呼……终于结束了～。\n比想象中结束得早，太好啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e4e219ade33e7a978d4ab8bad4e0cb9cabebb5bacd6dad43af3a327b61b85c3c","ja":"はい。萩原さんのおかげです。\nこの後、どこかへ遊びにいきませんか？","zh":"好的。多亏了萩原小姐。\n之后要不要去哪里玩一下？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"bee390e9935ceea7e5d648072e66293bf5784fab4c47de363e7f57bd6b7206d0","ja":"それなら私、おすすめのお茶屋さんがあって……\nあ、でも最近すっごくいい和カフェも見つけて……。","zh":"既然这样，我倒是有推荐的茶馆……\n啊，不过最近也发现了一家很棒的日式咖啡馆……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"232d61c433a20c1ce0eb4f1308fd83cc6250810d80ef0a5f38ecc60331f00325","ja":"どうしよう？　お店は反対方向だから、両方行くのは\n難しいし……でも、どっちも素敵で……！","zh":"该怎么办呢？两家店在相反的方向，两边都去\n有些困难……可是，哪一家都很吸引人……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"77856a963926094e425f8235c53692547f4599a0713cc34d276d72ff10fd04ae","ja":"では、まずはそのふたつのお店のことを\n詳しく聞かせてください。","zh":"那么，首先请跟我详细说说\n那两家店的情况吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"4f13dd832a3fa715366e402a29b554d68134746406d235aca1325288468de074","ja":"そして、どちらに行くか一緒に考えましょう。\n……協力し合い、です。","zh":"然后，一起想想该往哪边走吧。\n……互相协助，是也。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1602.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"0a27e12504e472bafe22adc1c1166a99c42d8e2316d709090571a3f674e6c751","ja":"あ……ふふ、そうだね♪　ありがとう、瑞希ちゃん。\nええとね、まずはお茶屋さんなんだけど……。","zh":"啊……呵呵，也是呢♪　谢谢你，瑞希。\n那个啊，首先是茶馆……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
